## Error Handling

- Display validation errors inline with form fields
- Show loading states on buttons during API calls
- Handle network errors gracefully
- Clear sensitive data on unmount or navigation

## Security Considerations

- Never log sensitive data (passwords, OTPs) in production
- Clear form data when navigating away from sensitive screens
- Implement proper session timeout
- Use secure parameter passing for sensitive data
  description:
  globs:
  alwaysApply: false

